/// banned user and {@link discussion_board_admins.id} for the administrator
/// who created the ban. When a user is unbanned, the unbanned_at timestamp
/// is recorded but the ban record remains for historical audit purposes.
///
/// Related entities: {@link discussion_board_members}, {@link
/// discussion_board_admins}, {@link discussion_board_audit_logs}
